Creating a **full-stack college website** involves both frontend and backend components. Since you asked for a professional, responsive, ready-to-use site with features like:

- Tailwind CSS
- Sticky navbar
- Logo and sections
- Animations and responsiveness  
Let’s now develop it into a **full-stack web app**.

---

## ✅ Full-Stack Tech Stack (Simple, Scalable & Modern)

| Layer        | Tech                        |
|--------------|-----------------------------|
| Frontend     | HTML + Tailwind CSS         |
| Backend      | Node.js + Express           |
| Database     | MongoDB (using Mongoose)    |
| Server       | Runs locally (can be hosted later) |

---

## 🎯 What the Site Will Do

- Display college info (home, about, departments, etc.)
- Store and display dynamic data (e.g., admission form submissions)
- Optional admin login to view records (we can add later)

---

